      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(1) This section applies if: ... (i) an APP entity holds personal information relating to one or more individuals; and (ii) the APP entity is required under section 15 not to do an act, or engage in a practice, that breaches Australian Privacy Principle 11.1 in relation to the personal information;",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
